~ start
Mayor: Welcome to Tauracre, traveler.
if has_active_mayor_quest()
	if is_mayor_quest_ready_to_turn_in()
		Mayor: You did it? That's wonderful news.
		do turn_in_mayor_quest()
		Mayor: Tauracre thanks you. Speak with me again if you want to help once more.
		=> END

	Mayor: You're still on Goblin Cleanup. Defeat 1 goblin and come back safe.
	=> END

Mayor: I need help with nearby goblins. Can you defeat just 1 goblin for us?
- Yes, I can help.
	do accept_mayor_quest()
	Mayor: Thank you. Please return after the goblin is dealt with.
	=> END
- No, not right now.
	Mayor: I understand. Come back when you're ready.
	=> END
